{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-server-panel-worker-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-3","surface":"server","area":"server/panel-worker","refs":["F-server-130","F-server-131","F-server-126","F-server-128"],"severity":"S2","title":"When a member pays the same request twice online, nobody at the gym is told","what":"The payment check and the payment company's notice both go through one step that marks a request paid. When a second, different payment arrives on a request that is already paid, the server keeps it in its own list of seen payments but only writes a hidden log line saying to check the company dashboard and refund it. The desk, the owner and MettleUp HQ are never shown it, so the member's extra money stays with the gym and the gym's books show one payment.","expected":"A second payment on one request shows to the owner (on Today or the payment list) as 'paid twice, refund one', and is counted for MettleUp.","evidence":["deploy/panel/pay.js:321-345","deploy/panel/pay.js:346-357","deploy/panel/pay.js:529-531","deploy/panel/pay.js:1511"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"second-payment-only-in-log","who":"members who pay twice, and the gym owner","how_often":"rare: whenever a payment page takes a second payment","fix_line":"Keep a 'paid twice' mark on the request and show it to the owner until it is refunded","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-server-panel-worker-b-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-4","surface":"server","area":"server/panel-worker","refs":["F-server-140","FN-B-run-server-panel-worker-a-03","FN-B-alerts-hq-app-b-04"],"severity":"S4","title":"A gym that asks for a demo twice becomes two new leads to call","what":"Every demo request and every 'Tell my gym' from the member app is saved as a new lead, even when the same number or the same gym is already a lead. HQ's to-call count counts each one. After you call the gym and mark one lead done, the other stays new, so the count stays up and you may call the same gym again.","expected":"A request from a number (or gym) that is already an open lead is added to that lead, so one gym is one lead to call.","evidence":["deploy/panel/leads.js:77-81","deploy/hq/web.js:203","deploy/hq/web.js:249"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"repeat-lead-not-merged","who":"MettleUp HQ","how_often":"whenever a gym asks twice or several members name the same gym","fix_line":"Join a new request to the open lead with the same number or gym name","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
